/-!
# A137408

Triangular sequence from coefficients of a switched even -odd polynomial recursion: odd:p(x,n)=2*x*p(x, n - 1) - p(x, n - 2); even:p(x,n)=(1 - 2*x)*p(x, n - 1) - p(x, n - 2);.

The 56 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A137408

